# ── Rust build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target/
**/target/

# ── Built binaries (kernel / loader / userland) ──────────────────────────────
*.efi
*.map
*.o
userland/*.elf
userland/*.signed

# ── Bootable disk images (build output) ──────────────────────────────────────
*.img
*.qcow2
*.vmdk
boot.ppm

# ── Runtime logs & packet captures ───────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.pcap

# ── SECRET: private Ed25519 signing seed — NEVER publish ─────────────────────
# The kernel embeds ONLY the matching public key (toolchain/eupkg/keys/dev.pub).
# Contributors generate their own dev keypair to build signed userland — see
# CONTRIBUTING.md. The project's release-signing key is held offline, not in git.
toolchain/eupkg/keys/dev.key

# ── Local web staging (site content, not part of the OS source) ──────────────
/web-staging/

# ── Editor / OS cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is INTENTIONALLY committed — EuroOS targets reproducible builds.

# Local Playwright/browser testing (node_modules)
/web-test/

# ── Loadtest / stress-run artifacts (raw run logs + result CSVs, regenerable) ─
# The summarized results live in docs/LOADTEST-TRACKER.md; raw runs stay local.
loadtest-*.out
loadtest-*.csv
scripts/loadtest-bugs.csv
scripts/__pycache__/

# ── Local site backup archives (not part of the OS source) ───────────────────
web-backup-*.tgz

# Generated SBOM (CycloneDX) — produced deterministically in CI per release
sbom.cdx.json
toolchain/update-server/repo/
userland/glibc/gbrk
